---
title: Photo sharing
---
flowchart TD
  %% Clients and the edge
  user((Mobile user)) --> cdn[CloudFront]
  user --> lb{Load balancer}
  lb -->|HTTPS| api(Photo API)
  subgraph core [Core services]
    api
    feed[Feed Service]
  end
  subgraph data ["Data layer"]
    photos[(Photos DB)]
    cache[(Redis)]
    blobs@{ shape: docs, label: "Photo files" }
  end
  api -- reads --> cache
  api -.-> photos
  api ==> uploads[[Upload events]]
  uploads --> thumbs(Thumbnail worker) & feed
  thumbs --> blobs
  feed --- photos
  api <--> feed
  note>Thumbnails are made asynchronously]
  classDef hot fill:#f96
  class api hot
